% ò¤ô
% Exercises detection of Form XObjects that combine graphics and visible text.
%
% The page contains:
% - Plain body text before the form ("Before graphic")
% - /Fm1: A Form XObject with a nested form drawing a rectangle path (/Fm1Box)
%   and visible text ("Inside graphic"), which qualifies as a graphic.
% - /Fm2: A Form XObject with text only ("Text only form"), which does not
%   qualify as a graphic.
% - /Fm3: A Form XObject with a path and invisible text (3 Tr), which does not
%   qualify as a graphic.
% - Plain body text after the forms ("After graphic")
1 0 obj <<
  /Type /Catalog
  /Pages 2 0 R
>>
endobj
2 0 obj <<
